source evidence for removal of global targetClass.\n\nProvide evidence_requests list with one entry: kind \"source\", query \"Provide source text that indicates nltl:QuantityValueShape should not have a global targetClass.\" reason.\n\nNow fill other required fields: issues empty array.\n\nUnchecked: list gaps from retrieval gaps indicating missing information. Could list a few unchecked entries based on earlier gaps. Probably include at least one to show unchecked material. Must include scope, material boolean, reason. We can include one for missing source evidence for removal. scope \"missing_targetclass_evidence\". material true. reason \"No source evidence provided for removal of sh:targetClass statements.\"\n\nNow assemble JSON.\n\nMake sure all fields present.\n\nLet's craft.\n\n","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":null,"status":null},{"id":"msg_8c1ae343d503c83f","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"{\n  \"candidate_version\": 2,\n  \"candidate_sha256\": \"8299aa76a8545444f27e97d1ba8598fbf006401131624d640c78f1c400a91ea0\",\n  \"review_request_id\": \"review:a13cb1b262706735aed0ee8f979701b0fdc45056ffd75b0161caafff03541de0\",\n  \"decision\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"issues\": [],\n  \"change_assessments\": [\n    {\n      \"change_id\": \"6c4559ea35b52bb68b6a96b33ee0704cee276fc0a6fc83beeac819d3297f6b3e\",\n      \"disposition\": \"UNRESOLVED\",\n      \"source_evidence_id\": \"E260\",\n      \"source_excerpt\": \"\\\"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterline> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> \\\\\\\"true\\\\\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .\\\"\",\n      \"reason\": \"The removal of the sh:targetClass statements (e.g., sh:targetClass qudt:QuantityValue) is not supported by any source evidence; the specification does not explicitly state that these target classes should be omitted. Consequently the removal disposition is UNRESOLVED.\",\n      \"candidate_location\": {\n        \"candidate_version\": 2,\n        \"cand